    <h2>Warm-up — Notice and Wonder: Two Curious Tables</h2>
    <p>Study both partially filled tables without completing every blank. Think for one minute, discuss with a partner, then explain one mathematical pattern. The question marks in the middle have a mathematically checkable value; the notices and explanations need teacher review.</p>
